## 4. Conditional Formatting (Dynamic Color) Measures

These measures return hex/color values used to dynamically format KPI cards — green when performance is favorable, red when unfavorable.

**Revbgcolor / RevValueColor**
```dax
Revbgcolor = 
IF([MoMRev%] >= 0, "#D4EDDA", "#F8D7DA")

RevValueColor = 
IF([MoMRev%] >= 0, "#155724", "#721C24")
```
Background and text color for the Revenue card — green if revenue is up MoM, red if down.

**Expbgcolor / ExpValueColor**
```dax
Expbgcolor = 
IF([MoMExp%] <= 0, "#D4EDDA", "#F8D7DA")

ExpValueColor = 
IF([MoMExp%] <= 0, "#155724", "#721C24")
```
Background and text color for the Expense card — green if expenses are down MoM (favorable), red if up.

**GPbgcolor / GPValueColor**
```dax
GPbgcolor = 
IF([MoMGP%] >= 0, "#D4EDDA", "#F8D7DA")

GPValueColor = 
IF([MoMGP%] >= 0, "#155724", "#721C24")
```
Background and text color for the Gross Profit card — green if gross profit is up MoM, red if down.

**NPbgcolor / NPValueColour**
```dax
NPbgcolor = 
IF([MoMNP%] >= 0, "#D4EDDA", "#F8D7DA")

NPValueColour = 
IF([MoMNP%] >= 0, "#155724", "#721C24")
```
Background and text color for the Net Profit card — green if net profit is up MoM, red if down.
